{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f435f79d45fb121d4f2b3c59b7f3b6a63d411b729de489ed768ad74b2ff7cbe1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fe2fddfa99cdfc49cb16e647f6d93caab1a8771329dacb04dd3577161988514",
      "text": "身为派对主角的自觉",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37cdbdefe8e2604dde8471a146b65aedda691eadfe6a4c77680121c067116d65",
      "text": "对自己的生日并不怎么上心的恭二。\n恭二以两人工作繁忙为由想要推掉派对，\n实和皮埃尔努力劝说他，\n并抽空在工作间隙筹备派对，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fe2fddfa99cdfc49cb16e647f6d93caab1a8771329dacb04dd3577161988514",
      "text": "身为派对主角的自觉",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb7e60929f671fd13b276e3a72845ca5285cc631c2569d08e90798621b07a3c5",
      "text": "恭二。你应该知道的吧，\n2月2日一定要空出来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbca09505fe64f952bbf109da598196519e6022180f7e4dc801323930965e4eb",
      "text": "2月2日……是我的生日啊。\n有什么安排吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1034b9bf8d9b45d286b860e97bd78b62993b1367410abd2ba9ecdfa9da5dbfd0",
      "text": "当然是恭二的生日派对啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65d948be0b29f1e3a37480ea2259b39bd44c15571ad47c39fc5c30f47d0fe948",
      "text": "大家一起庆祝！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef05085cb215aa07a9f5b2f6b6da23a74e863a7ca5b0e58790f59ca3f6baf48b",
      "text": "派对？\n算了吧。你们两个也挺忙的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b5be1be82f0677e1ebcf23a432b687f12f6e7b2ac26e75396b4177f5336da1c",
      "text": "不许说这种话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25f571135ee9a3691340060b9435a976a266400c8baf77606d3e6b2d2723966b",
      "text": "生日，一年只有一次……是特别的日子。\n我今年也想为恭二庆祝！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26832ab776b524dad5ba32abcf71b1b37450b7c4e6d48050173b38493218d83",
      "text": "准备，我会加油的。\n恭二，求你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69a66b57b3b58c0220da6c162a64d4d0771899fae360faf92acc50cf973a8b96",
      "text": "哈哈，这都搞不清到底谁才是被庆祝的一方了。\n那就拜托你们了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:495e251ab4db04d53411bfb1a573047053a2a845f081694356625a3e4afa2ee9",
      "text": "呀呼——！\n要办开心的派对。好好期待着吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17b7c80d7ebb498c8b87e9822b49d4207bb214793d3bc97ed038df2a0313ed10",
      "text": "之前拜托的包下休息室的事，\n已经得到社长的许可了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8980959d3b844c4e22e4c087559f46411b50cf592fea2153d760345163e61f8",
      "text": "真的吗？太好啦——！\n制作人，谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c230e716912cccb42d045f1a30c145078bcc7c1d67f7818070efc829d178db1f",
      "text": "真不愧是制作人，办事效率真高。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:579001e9beeb22749e999bd4cc66ea4103174c6acc38128adf54d517e7d39c63",
      "text": "要是还有什么需要，请随时告诉我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e7528b25d1135bcd1a575e4e68eeb582834222d4b05625e393872549c438727",
      "text": "谢谢。呵呵，感觉会是一场很棒的派对呢。\n我们这边的准备也在顺利推进中哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5de39dc62bbdd244fed9650dfb02cb2c478943b902698dafa99af9333f30a4ca",
      "text": "嗯！我在做装饰。\n做很多很多，让恭二开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b94880260bff165ef7465be88591ed0db34bc8168e3a25e26012154a07ecd339",
      "text": "我在用生日花做花束。\n设计大概是这种感觉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbb12fac940fcd461f29863217a0f0622bb24d1f8cd7ab316e1136048762c119",
      "text": "两位在工作之余居然准备了这么多……\n一定会成为一场美妙的派对呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce9595605868ad24cc80c6b222ab46679cd4d1b38214cd746faee89b5b941ec9",
      "text": "谢谢！我和实，都最喜欢恭二了。\n所以，能超努力加油♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19d121950491014ea0c45c26f211dc30761ea6235ece8c499e335c41414db43",
      "text": "是啊。当天恭二会露出怎样的表情呢……\n光是想象一下就干劲十足了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f95e175010e73956089568a0d2417e52f21367c54fd9c404a14402e29213909",
      "text": "（呼……今天的课程真严酷啊。\n明天也还有，回家早点睡吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41a7536fc32d302e460cd0702e7055406fa84a1bc602708773f0af539eb6ad16",
      "text": "（但是，今天有哪怕熬夜也想玩通关的游戏……\n稍微去趟事务所马上就回家吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:708111400c446d3d3720bd8ae11ca740967134854c71726b78ab33aeccff3da5",
      "text": "我去拿咖啡来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a65383691e41026f9ae7f9a083c456ca4f15fd02cf74d98f8a5eb5f3fd6ab71e",
      "text": "嗯？皮埃尔的声音？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5ad91b0dbf38a3ccfa415e701800812f9b84f8a7c2fba6ab8e5c88afc519412",
      "text": "啊，恭二！\n辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:930fb93261308a7ae191e6caae56acf9ccd0d673231d13e9f61dabcd205c0040",
      "text": "哦……皮埃尔也还在工作吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d4c14e5852d95b1b0265c1570b071636516dc0ca45f581d58802d1b5ec81a1a",
      "text": "不是，在准备恭二的派对哦。\n实也在一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e68bee69cbc82e6d0d9b6c9f1f4c9596d1272c2c310045c381f851275411eeb",
      "text": "我的？\n这样啊……喂，我也来帮忙吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb9c7aff2ad90b1229252ef40b739cdc6b103f1e56fc1660dc2b2b3b90a0667",
      "text": "不行。恭二，是派对的主宾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d5fd68f519d8be7af90a056d60c46a2277bc06f58c789cc0cdded067e40bc01",
      "text": "咦，我还以为听到恭二的声音了呢……\n辛苦啦。看起来今天相当拼命了呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e7a38d6eeb6b50446ff13d9c7cd38666a09edac64ee3df8648e989b0b150b00",
      "text": "今天就快去休息吧。就像皮埃尔说的那样，\n我们希望恭二能满怀期待地迎来当天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ff8fa1fe8d6a88b376ea6b52a5903c9f5333d59f9e0ceea07ce10391aebd2d6",
      "text": "这、样啊……谢谢你们。\n不过，你们两个也别太勉强了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2abd8afe8899e9a0d1fd4e19d6980c3362697e3759e0928fa8ee581f30bd7ef5",
      "text": "从事务所回家的路上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:466981acb0840f5eba1b2022327c52053f55671224b56ab69895e9079f6a22a2",
      "text": "（瞄了一眼会议室里面，\n那些装饰全都是皮埃尔和实先生做的吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26d0df2ac418fa4988589ec2f5f3d70baad18c01e8c4816579a81caeb9785fcd",
      "text": "（他们俩工作应该也很忙才对，\n却特意为了我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b34bf2ba608cb7274f04e22824fb96012c7806d534d1044627cc308ca8cb137",
      "text": "（这么一想，总觉得心里不太踏实。\n有种莫名坐立不安的感觉）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e580705408ce3653146da96c87a207c5a463f9a6944a337f4c3f8d22578527a",
      "text": "（……离生日还有几天来着，之类的。\n明明以前从来没在意过这种事）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35654de1f32b963722064b2a6e17996ccd3e94869fa6170626e7fc3d292b3969",
      "text": "（总觉得，这种感觉也挺让人开心的啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73ef8b867ab9794d5adf6471c24b26a7ae3b8c5c46b47ac6580fb363e1c9b7b2",
      "text": "（……我能做到的，\n可不只是满怀期待地等待当天而已吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0724a39187f5d10257e7860e1746d91fa9995bdd3bf20f5d014c19b9a4c27112",
      "text": "（为了能够尽情享受派对，\n我也要把自己的工作好好干好才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a656b7d2b2fb7d281eb4d23b4b57083477a17f3bcc69b50b84ec60e6070f6812",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4d37640d4df1365a12550dc7787436a14732eedb9b9bb13ac1cf0403bf6408f",
      "text": "（游戏……就留到下一个休息日吧，\n今晚吃完饭早点睡觉好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d49b196ea13d8d7d5243f3e88926df0f0ea0bbbab708b2ccfb7c173f42e4aa3",
      "text": "生日派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c1ed44262f97eb6e009fe9b6eb985d951203eabc39563e9ad935c6bd7980855",
      "text": "预备——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b38131093737bbdcc63120d98729d7c79f2e34f961dae277514178d49a58358",
      "text": "恭二，祝你生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b22722680d4402b2216f595b9c167a7ea12b761f59d16967441b23f951709e87",
      "text": "祝你生日快乐，恭二。\n呵呵，惊讶的表情很不错嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83057d21c0cf84aeabe516f5f3a23ecbf9c04eb9ce6cbb2670f7e6f8ea99a49b",
      "text": "不是，因为……这完全超出了想象啊。\n布置也好……这个花束也是，真的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c30d55c7bbaf4fa77e24490b6659c3bd71efb0c46a669d12c7152ce99cb852eb",
      "text": "而且菜品和蛋糕也都这么豪华。\n……我超级开心的。谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fa14e8b37cc2315a599ec07c248a656e8c6e4afc8fc7678694eb7c66aac07ee",
      "text": "蛋糕是制作人准备的。\n这些菜是商店街肉铺的，这边是鱼铺的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13a5a473924f0f81107246ebdc369fa349c6dbdacc0ba96a151307d08d548464",
      "text": "说是要办派对，大家都多送了好多菜。\n商店街的大家，最喜欢恭二了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c423473bc2b2dda0befded8cb6316ed2ed04b4de290e9945db6acd7331c76dea",
      "text": "这样啊……也得跟商店街的大家道谢才行呢。\n还有帮忙准备的制作人也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340a20ea42d177d3492b443bfca6d2038ba398fa6ac091aca196c862153c277f",
      "text": "来！今天就尽情享受吧！\n礼物也准备好了，敬请期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70bc709713b29a96ff615b46ab015b19a85f5e34cba1a6d1088212cf4e892c78",
      "text": "好的。非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
